4.
Public Input and Unscheduled Personal Appearances
Each person will be limited to 3 minutes on agenda items only.  The purpose of this agenda item is to provide an opportunity for citizens' comments on agenda items.  Council members do not engage in discussion under this agenda item, and staff members are directed not to.  If you seek discussion or inquiry, please contact your Councilmember, the Mayor or the office of the City Manager.  Responses to citizen comments, if any, will occur under the applicable agenda item or may be reserved for further response by phone call, personal meeting, or a posting on the website:
www.miamiokla.net
5.
CONSENT AGENDA
By unanimous consent the public body may designate noncontroversial items to be considered in one motion and one vote.  The public body may add items from the regular agenda and approve. Posted agenda items not added to the consent docket will be considered separately in their regular order.  Staff recommends that Item 6 through Item 13 be placed on the consent agenda.
